        "question": "What are good vintage shop names?",
        "answer": "Names that hint at an era or a second life: Then Again Vintage, Sixties Archive, Chintz & Chrome or Dust & Gold. Puns such as Retro Active suit a clothing rail; a classic name suits an antiques centre."
